msgstr "Livre des certitudes"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:121
msgid ""
"A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for {0} more. A wrong slip: {1} less."
msgstr ""
"Lecture parfaite : tout le contenu du coffre se vend {0} plus cher. Fiche erronée : {1} moins cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid "Truthglass"
msgstr "Verre de vérité"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid "A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for half as much again."
msgstr "Lecture parfaite : tout le contenu du coffre se vend moitié plus cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:126
msgid "Padded Crate"
msgstr "Caisse rembourrée"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:126
msgid "Glass never breaks when you drop a chest."
msgstr "Le verre ne casse jamais quand vous laissez tomber un coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid "Smuggler's Hook"
msgstr "Grappin de contrebandier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid "Smugglers come your way: false bottoms turn up twice as often."
msgstr ""
"Les contrebandiers viennent à vous : les doubles fonds apparaissent deux fois plus souvent."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:128
msgid "Hollow Rod"
msgstr "Tige creuse"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:128
msgid ""
"What's under a false bottom comes out a step better: people hid their best."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui se cache sous un double fond sort un cran au-dessus : on y cachait ce qu'on avait de mieux."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid "Smuggler's Log"
msgstr "Journal de contrebandier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid ""
"Smugglers trust a buyer who keeps quiet: each false bottom you open this run makes false bottoms {0} likelier (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque double fond ouvert dans la partie rend les doubles fonds {0} plus probables (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid "Black Market Pass"
msgstr "Sésame du marché noir"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid ""
"Thornwick's black market pays double for anything from under a false bottom."
msgstr ""
"Le marché noir de Thornwick paie le double pour tout ce qui sort d'un double fond."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:132
msgid "Smugglers' Compass"
msgstr "Boussole des contrebandiers"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:132
msgid "Every chest has a false bottom."
msgstr "Tous les coffres ont un double fond."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:135
msgid "Warden's Lantern"
msgstr "Lanterne de Gardien"

