msgid ""
"Every chest has a warded thing, and its seller tells you a sign for it."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre contient un objet scellé, et son vendeur vous en donne un signe."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid "Lucky Shell"
msgstr "Coquillage porte-bonheur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid ""
"A dry spell ends twice as soon: luck starts to turn after {0} plain finds, not {1}."
msgstr ""
"Une mauvaise passe dure moitié moins : la chance tourne après {0} trouvailles ordinaires, et non {1}."

